@base = http://127.0.0.1:4317

### Health
GET {{base}}/healthz

### Capabilities
GET {{base}}/v1/capabilities

### Enhance a Chinese data task
POST {{base}}/v1/enhance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "把这份推广费用表分析一下，写份报告给领导汇报",
  "target": "data",
  "mode": "fast",
  "locale": "zh-CN"
}

### Enhance an English agent task
POST {{base}}/v1/enhance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Have the agent clean up my downloads folder and ask before deleting anything",
  "target": "agent",
  "mode": "balanced",
  "locale": "en"
}
